sized cream sweater, photographed from directly above with a 24mm lens at f/4.0, her expression calm and contemplative, skin showing natural pores, subtle lines, and blemishes.\nMake this person recline sideways across a sofa in a red silk dress, captured from a low front angle at eye level with an 85mm lens at f/1.8, expression dreamy with a faint smile, skin showing pores, light wrinkles, and realistic surface detail.\nMake this person stand in profile against a plain white wall in a black business suit, hands tucked into her pockets, framed with a 50mm lens at f/2.5 from a side angle, expression serious and composed, skin rendered with pores, imperfections, and faint wrinkles.\nMake this person sit at an outdoor café table in a yellow sundress, leaning forward with both elbows on the surface, viewed from a tilted dutch angle with a 35mm lens at f/2.2, smiling warmly, skin showing realistic pores, slight blemishes, and texture.\nMake this person walk barefoot along the shoreline in a white flowing skirt and pastel blue tank top, photographed from a low ground angle with a 24mm lens at f/4.0, her face turned upward with a soft smile, skin detailed with natural pores, imperfections, and wrinkles.\nMake this person crouch near a city fountain at night in a black leather jacket and dark jeans, hands resting on her knees, captured with a wide 28mm lens at f/3.2 from slightly above, expression playful and laughing, skin showing pores, wrinkles, and subtle blemishes.\nMake this person stand on a rooftop edge in an oversized olive-green coat, framed from a dramatic low side angle with a 35mm lens at f/2.8, expression serious with a distant gaze, skin rendered with realistic pores, imperfections, and faint wrinkles.\nMake this person sit on the floor against a blank wall in grey workout leggings and a white tank top, knees pulled close to her chest, photographed from a high angle with a 50mm lens at f/2.0, expression tired but calm, skin showing pores, small blemishes, and lifelike detail.\nMake this person stand in an art gallery in a dark green fitted dress, leaning slightly with arms crossed, captured from a slightly high diagonal angle with a 35mm lens at f/2.5, expression contemplative, skin rendered with natural pores, wrinkles, and blemishes.", "", 0, 1000], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "prepend_text"}, "name": "prepend_text", "label": "prepend_text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "prepend_text"}, {"widget": {"name": "multiline_text"}, "name": "multiline_text", "link": 46, "label": "multiline_text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "multiline_text"}, {"widget": {"name": "append_text"}, "name": "append_text", "label": "append_text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "append_text"}, {"widget": {"name": "start_index"}, "name": "start_index", "label": "start_index", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "start_index"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_rows"}, "name": "max_rows", "label": "max_rows", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_rows"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CR Prompt List", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [437.16241455078125, 474.3739318847656], "pos": [1943.306396484375, 407.93194580078125], "id": 25, "properties": {"cnr_id": "ComfyUI_Comfyroll_CustomNodes", "ver": "d78b780ae43fcf8c6b7c6505e6ffb4584281ceca", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {"append_text": true, "start_index": true, "max_rows": true, "multiline_text": true, "prepend_text": true}, "version": "7.0.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "CR Prompt List"}, "order": 21}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [46], "label": "字符串", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [400, 200], "pos": [1528.6575927734375, 335.70782470703125], "widgets_values": ["Make this person stand at a crosswalk in a beige raincoat, captured from a low side angle with a 35mm lens at f/2.8, her profile framed against blurred neon reflections on wet pavement, expression calm and focused, skin showing pores, wrinkles, and subtle 